    ELENA
  Right ascension 19 hours, 50 minutes. Declination plus eight degrees. The Oort cloud.

    MARCUS
  Nothing is out there. Nothing with power output like that.

    ELENA
  There is now. And Marcus? It is modulating in mathematical primes.

